Message 23412
For % &
                            General Alex Kolman
                            Saint Georges Base
                            Mount Phoenix

Have you tried the Lenda baths, they are divine !

The Emperor is wary, despite the recent victories,
the enemy has conquered several bases.

We must take back the Island of Mikado in the west.
Our enemies are solidly implanted and the odds are that
the Psychos are going to install their terrible arm :
"The Buzz Bombs".

If you give them the time to see their plan through, our
base on the island of Tomogashi and that of our ally on
the island of Suru-Suru will be in range of their missiles.

The allied base of Suru-Suru is very small and they won't
be able to contain an enemy attack. You need to massively
bombard the Psychos installations in the south-west in
order to enable our allies to land.

If they succeed in their landing the game is won.